Description: 4k intro by Faemiyah, released in 2018
 Adarkar Wastes is a 4k intro by Faemiyah (Juippi, Trilkk), released at
 Instanssi 2018, where it ranked 1st in the combined 4k competition.
 .
 This package contains the standard (non size-optimized) build of the
 intro. Press F to toggle fullscreen and Esc to quit.

Package: adarkarwastes-by-faemiyah-data
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Data files for adarkarwastes-by-faemiyah
 Adarkar Wastes is a 4k intro by Faemiyah, released at Instanssi 2018.
 .
 This package contains the shaders and the precalculated soundtrack
 (compressed as FLAC) used by adarkarwastes-by-faemiyah.

